# monitor RMQ reconnect hardening (keep quorum)

Reduce broker load during mass monitor reconnect and post-outage publish bursts without changing collectors (`disable_types`, `sample_freq` unchanged). Operator will raise `send_freq` in `/etc/hpcperfstats/hpcperfstats.conf` separately.

**Governed by:** `agent-discipline-core.mdc`, `plan-completion-gate.mdc`, `plan-creation-contract.mdc`, `plan-live-disk-sync.mdc`, `implementation-review-workflow.mdc`.

**Scope:** `HPCPerfStats/monitor/` only (`stats_buffer_rmq.c`, `monitor_daemon.c`, tests). Pipeline `listend` changes are **out of scope** (see separate `listend-rmq-peer-reset` plan). **Forbidden:** classic queue type; connection pooling / aggregator architecture in this plan.

