## Invariants / edge cases

| Case | Expected |
|------|----------|
| Quorum queue on broker | Passive declare succeeds; no classic `x-queue-type` from monitor |
| Queue genuinely missing | Active declare+bind fallback |
| First publish after long outage | Burst cap applies; multiple ticks to drain ring |
| send_freq raised to 600+ | Backoff cap scales; heartbeat still ≥30s |
| SIGHUP reload | `stats_buffer_rmq_shutdown()` + reconnect; backoff state policy documented (reset vs carry) |
| 32 MiB soft cap | Unchanged; `$` payloads still isolated |
| Fleet simultaneous restart | Jitter reduces alignment; does not eliminate ~N connections |

